    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>signed 256-bit integer with the operations necessary for exact geometric predicates: the exact product of two <ref refid="group__GeneralGroup_1ga626821a3551ab1b67dc553a092bd0a2f" kindref="member">FastInt128</ref> (see mulExact below), addition, subtraction and comparison; as <ref refid="group__GeneralGroup_1ga626821a3551ab1b67dc553a092bd0a2f" kindref="member">FastInt128</ref> it lacks conversion in double, sqrt-function and stream input/output; there is no operator * on purpose: a product of two 256-bit values rarely fits in 256 bits </para>
    </detaileddescription>
